Backport libevent 2.1.13-stable security fixes onto the Debian 2.1.12-stable-10 source.

Fixes CVE-2026-63379, CVE-2026-63381, CVE-2026-63382, CVE-2026-63383,
CVE-2026-63384, CVE-2026-63385, CVE-2026-63387, and CVE-2026-63388.

Upstream release: https://github.com/libevent/libevent/releases/tag/release-2.1.13-stable
Compare: https://github.com/libevent/libevent/compare/release-2.1.12-stable...release-2.1.13-stable

Adaptation: security-relevant source hunks from the 2.1.13-stable release diff;
non-security version bumps, build-system, and compiler-warning commits are omitted.

